for you. This listens for a message of 'testslackfileupload' followed by the name of the file you want to send to slack. You can obviously set the file name within the script rather than passing it in through the message if you want.\n\n```\n# Description:\n#   contains listener that will upload file to slack\n#\n# Commands:\n#   hubot testslackfileupload \u0026lt;filename\u0026gt; - uploads file to slack with the filename passed in\n#\n# Author:\n#   juilianoj\n\nmodule.exports = (robot) -\u0026gt;\t\n\trobot.respond /testslackfileupload (.*)/i, (res) -\u0026gt;\n\t\tfilename = res.match[1]\n\n\t\topts = {\n\t\t\tcontent: 'the content of your file'\n\t\t\ttitle: 'Your Test File Title As Displayed In Slack'\n\t\t\tchannels: res.message.room\n\t\t}\n\t\trobot.adapter.client.web.files.upload(filename, opts)\n\n```\n\nThe result looks like this, and when you download the file it would have the file name you passed in:\n\n\u003chttps://user-images.githubusercontent.com/5711009/50719067-a69f3c80-105c-11e9-82d9-457f06efed3b.png|image\u003e","image_url":"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/5711009/50719067-a69f3c80-105c-11e9-82d9-457f06efed3b.png","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/slackapi/hubot-slack|slackapi/hubot-slack\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1546654271}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZcF/J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3052b63-f4c9-404c-9f2a-ed47ac393798","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"hubot-slack に、でかい出力の場合はスニペットにするオプションみたいなのほしい","ts":"1633505245.345100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":2,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","UEACRCY0Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nrx3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b12aa0df-cc89-4293-a673-a518e47dcd1f","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":":kan: :sha:","ts":"1633505220.344600","t